A||N||2||Chris McDonald||86 1/2-88 H/L motors-special project-need help||||5||
Z||000000||Chris McDonald||08-15-2001||07:42 AM||||It has been a while since I made any posts here.  <P>This time I need your help.  I am working on a special project and need to know something about your 86 1/2 to 88 (newer style) headlamp actuator motors (two wire).<P>What controls the motion of your headlights?  Do you have several relays like the 84-86 Fiero (three wire motors), or do you have the single control module like the Vettes and Lotus use with the same newer style motors?<P>If you know what you have, and how it works, please post ASAP.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Indyrestoguy_JR||08-15-2001||08:54 AM||||On all '86 GTs the headlight motors (3 wire) work with several relays just like all '84-'86 cars.<BR>The '87 & '88 models use only 1 module to work both motors and are the 2 wire style.<P>What else you want to know?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Chris McDonald||08-15-2001||11:17 AM||||That answers my question.<BR>||||reg||1
